  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <color=#ffc51c>10 LINES
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<color=#ffc51c>Bet Per Line: 1'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_0
    value: <style=title><size=32><color=#3fccf6>WILD</style></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: "- Appears on <b>2</b>, <b>3</b>, <b>4</b> and <b>5</b> reels and\n  substitutes
      for all symbols.\n- Might turn to a <b>Multiplier Wild</b>             ."
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_1
    value: <style=title><size=32><color=#3fccf6>BONUS</style></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: "- Appears only during <b>Bonus Mode</b> and\n  becomes locked until end
      of <b>Bonus Mode</b>."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_0
    value: <style=title><size=32><color=#3fccf6>PROGRESSION FEATURE</style></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: "- There is a progression bar that contains <b>8</b> steps.\n- These steps
      represent <b>Symbols</b> in <b>Base Games</b>.\n- Player can fill any of these
      steps regardless of the order.\n- Each time when player has a win line, <b>PORTION</b>
      of the relevant step will be filled.\n     - <b>Wild</b> can be part of a win.\n-
      Once player fills all steps, <b>Bonus Mode</b> will be activated."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_1
    value: <style=title><size=32><color=#3fccf6>BASE GAME</style></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=24>5 <color=#ffc51c>{2:CommaNumber}</color>

      4 <color=#ffc51c>{1:CommaNumber}</color>

      3 <color=#ffc51c>{0:CommaNumber}</color></size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_2
    value: <style=title><size=32><color=#3fccf6>BONUS MODE</style></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: "- Fully filled progression bar triggers <b>Bonus Mode</b> with <b>7</b>
      re-spins.\n- During <b>Bonus Mode</b>, only <b>Bonus Symbols</b>             landing
      on reels are valid.\n- Any <b>Bonus Symbols</b>             that appear during
      <b>Bonus Mode</b> get locked\n  until there are no remaining re-spins.\n     -
      Each re-spin, one or more             on reels awards <b>+1</b> spin.\n     -
      If all <b>15</b> spots are filled with             during <b>Bonus Mode</b>,
      <b>Guess or Dare Bonus</b>\n       is triggered right away.\n- Once <b>Bonus
      Mode</b> ends, <b>Bonus Game</b> starts right away.\n- Player's position on
      <b>Bonus ladder</b> depends on the amount of <b>Bonus Symbols</b> on reels\n
      \ when entering <b>Guess or Dare Bonus</b>."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_3
    value: <style=title><size=32><color=#3fccf6>GUESS OR DARE BONUS</style></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: "- There is a ladder with <b>16</b> steps and player starts at a step on
      the ladder\n  depending on the number of <b>Bonus Symbols</b> at the end of
      <b>Bonus Mode</b>.\n- There are two numbers in <b>Guess or Dare Bonus</b>.\n-
      <b>Target Number</b>: reveals a random number from <b>5</b> to <b>15</b> every
      step.\n- <b>Player's Number</b>: reveals a random number from <b>0</b> to <b>20</b>
      every step.\n- In order to move higher on the ladder, player chooses '<b>High</b>'
      or '<b>Low</b>', guessing\n  if <b>Player's Number</b> will be higher or lower
      than <b>Target Number</b>.\n 1. If player's guess is correct, then move onto
      the next step of the ladder.\n 2. If player's guess is incorrect, then player
      wins the prize from the closest safe step.\n- Anytime before choosing '<b>High</b>'
      or '<b>Low</b>', player can take prize and quit <b>Bonus</b>.\n- There are safe
      steps on the ladder and if player is at such step or above that step,\n  all
      wins from previous steps are safely saved.\n- Player can receive the prize on
      the closest safe stop when player lost the game. "
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=32><color=#3fccf6>LINES</style></size>
